sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant WEB as Next.js Dashboard
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant OR as Orchestrator
    participant AG as Agent Services (×5)

    Dev->>WEB: open a repository's Pull requests tab
    WEB->>GW: GET /v1/repositories/{id}/pulls (Supabase session)
    GW->>GH: list open pull requests (cached 30 s)
    GW-->>WEB: open PRs, each with its latest review
    Dev->>WEB: click Re-run review on a pull request

    WEB->>GW: POST /v1/reviews { repositoryId, pullRequestNumber }
    GW->>GW: verify session, resolve organization
    GW->>GH: read the pull request

    alt not open, reviews off, base branch not reviewed, or a review started < 30 s ago
        GW-->>WEB: 404 / 409 with an error code
        WEB-->>Dev: say why, nothing is queued
    else reviewable
        GW->>GH: list changed files, filter lockfiles, binaries, generated
        GW->>OR: POST /internal/v1/review-jobs (trigger = dashboard_manual)
        Note over GW,OR: an older running review of the same PR is cancelled
        OR-->>GW: 202 { reviewId }
        GW-->>WEB: 202 { reviewId, status }
        WEB-->>Dev: open the review page, showing it in progress

        par agents run in parallel
            OR->>AG: POST /v1/review
            AG-->>OR: findings[]
        end
        OR->>OR: aggregate, de-duplicate, rank, store the report

        loop while the review is running
            WEB->>GW: GET /v1/reviews/{id}
            GW-->>WEB: status, and the report once completed
        end
        WEB-->>Dev: findings grouped by agent and severity
        Note over GW,GH: Check Run and comments are posted as in UC-1
    end

    Note over Dev,WEB: accepting or rejecting a single AI fix follows UC-3
